<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Orden de Pago en Efectivo - JUVECONF 2025</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #0a0a0a; color: #ffffff;">
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: #0a0a0a;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding: 40px 20px;">
        <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width: 600px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #0a0a0a 100%); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(139, 63, 255, 0.3);">

          <!-- Header -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 40px 40px 30px; text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B3FFF 0%, #6B2FDF 100%);">
              <div style="background-color: #CCFF00; display: inline-block; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <span style="color: #8B3FFF; font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 1.5px;">JUVECONF 2025</span>
              </div>
              <h1 style="color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">¡Orden en Progreso! 💰</h1>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Content -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 40px;">

              <!-- Greeting -->
              <p style="font-size: 18px; color: #e0e0e0; margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 1.6;">
                Hola <strong style="color: #CCFF00;">{{userName}}</strong>,
              </p>

              <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #b0b0b0; margin: 0 0 30px; line-height: 1.6;">
                Tu orden de pago en efectivo para <strong style="color: #8B3FFF;">JUVECONF 2025</strong> ha sido creada exitosamente.
              </p>

              <!-- Order ID Box -->
              <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 63, 255, 0.1) 0%, rgba(107, 47, 223, 0.1) 100%); border: 2px solid #8B3FFF; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin: 0 0 30px; text-align: center;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; color: #b0b0b0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">ID de Orden</p>
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #8B3FFF; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; word-break: break-all;">{{orderId}}</p>
              </div>

              <!-- Payment Instructions -->
              <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.1) 0%, rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.05) 100%); border: 2px solid #CCFF00; border-radius: 12px; padding: 25px; margin: 0 0 30px;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 16px; color: #CCFF00; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-align: center;">
                  💵 Instrucciones de Pago en Efectivo
                </p>
                <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 8px 0;">
                      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #d0d0d0; line-height: 1.8;">
                        <span style="color: #CCFF00; font-weight: 700;">1.</span> Acercate al punto de venta autorizado
                      </p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 8px 0;">
                      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #d0d0d0; line-height: 1.8;">
                        <span style="color: #CCFF00; font-weight: 700;">2.</span> Presentá tu DNI y el ID de orden
                      </p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 8px 0;">
                      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #d0d0d0; line-height: 1.8;">
                        <span style="color: #CCFF00; font-weight: 700;">3.</span> Realizá el pago por <strong style="color: #CCFF00;">${{amount}} ARS</strong>
                      </p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 8px 0;">
                      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #d0d0d0; line-height: 1.8;">
                        <span style="color: #CCFF00; font-weight: 700;">4.</span> Guardá el comprobante de pago
                      </p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </div>

              <!-- Next Steps -->
              <div style="background-color: rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.05); border-left: 4px solid #CCFF00; padding: 20px; margin: 0 0 20px; border-radius: 4px;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #CCFF00; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">
                  📌 Próximos Pasos
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #d0d0d0; line-height: 1.6;">
                  Una vez que hayas realizado el pago en efectivo, debes contactarte por WhatsApp para confirmar tu compra.
                </p>
              </div>

              <!-- WhatsApp Contact -->
              <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.1) 0%, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.05) 100%); border: 2px solid #25D366; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin: 0 0 20px; text-align: center;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 15px; font-size: 14px; color: #25D366; font-weight: 700;">
                  📱 Contacto WhatsApp
                </p>
                <a href="https://wa.me/5492914127933" style="display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #25D366 0%, #128C7E 100%); color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 30px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.4);">
                  +54 9 291 412-7933
                </a>
              </div>

              <!-- Important Notice -->
              <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.1) 0%, rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.05) 100%); border: 2px solid #FFC107; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin: 0 0 30px;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #FFC107; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">
                  ⚠️ Importante
                </p>
                <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #d0d0d0; line-height: 1.8;">
                  <li style="margin: 8px 0;">Un administrador debe <strong style="color: #FFC107;">verificar tu pago manualmente</strong></li>
                  <li style="margin: 8px 0;">Recibirás un correo de confirmación cuando se apruebe tu entrada</li>
                  <li style="margin: 8px 0;">Este proceso puede tomar hasta <strong style="color: #FFC107;">48 horas</strong></li>
                </ul>
                <p style="margin: 15px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #d0d0d0; line-height: 1.6;">
                  Si no recibes respuesta en las próximas 48 horas, contáctanos por
                  <a href="https://www.instagram.com/icevidaeterna" style="color: #8B3FFF; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 700;">@icevidaeterna</a>
                </p>
              </div>

            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 30px 40px; text-align: center; background-color: #0f0f0f; border-top: 1px solid #2a2a2a;">
              <div style="background-color: #CCFF00; display: inline-block; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
                <span style="color: #8B3FFF; font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px;">JUVECONF</span>
              </div>
              <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #606060; line-height: 1.5;">
                © 2025 JUVECONF. Todos los derechos reservados.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
